          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ویران شدن (virân shodan) — \"to be destroyed, to be ruined\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "در زلزله صدها خانه ویران شد. Dar zelzele sad-hâ khâne virân shod. Hundreds of houses were destroyed in the earthquake."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present virân mishavad. Virân \"ruined\" is also an adjective."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "virân \"desolate, ruined\" is a native Persian word that EtymDB lists without a parent; shodan \"to become\" is inherited Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
